"text": "He finally reached the edge of the universe, but it was an enormous white wall, stretching farther than his instruments could measure. He put on a suit and exited his craft for a closer look. It was made of paper, billions of sheets pinned together. Each one was a drawing. As he drifted closer, he realized they were drawn by children, and every single one was of a person. A man in a turban, an old woman, a baby, a soldier. He reached out and touched one of an Asian girl, but his hand was pulled through. Space began to swallow him. The pressure stretched him before he finally saw a blinding light. It was cold. He opened her eyes to a hospital ceiling. A woman was crying above him, holding him close. The nurse spoke in Mandarin. He realized he had just been born as the Asian girl, and all his memories began to fade.",
